<title>UK: Sigma Finance adds 75 mln Sfr to five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sigma Finance adds 75 mln Sfr to five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased by 75 million Swiss francs, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SIGMA FINANCE</p>
<p> AMT   *200 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.25	MATURITY    29.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE**101.50    PAY DATE    29.NOV.96</p>
<p>LISTING     EBS	 DENOMS (K) 5	   GOV LAW     SWISS</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   NO</p>
<p> NOTES     *LAUNCHED FOR 125 MILLION SWISS FRANCS ON 30.OCT.96</p>
<p>	    **NEW ISSUE PRICE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
